<div class="space-y-8 text-on-surface-variant">
<div>
<h3 class="font-title-lg text-primary mb-3">Embracing an Indian Diet for Weight Loss</h3>
<p class="font-body-md">Many believe that Indian food is inherently fattening, but this is a misconception. Traditional Indian diets are incredibly balanced, rich in fiber from lentils, vitamins from seasonal vegetables, and healthy fats from moderation of ghee and nuts. We harness this ancient wisdom to create effective weight loss strategies that don't force you to abandon your cultural roots.</p>
</div>
<div>
<h3 class="font-title-lg text-primary mb-3">Your Customized Nutrition Plan</h3>
<p class="font-body-md">There is no one-size-fits-all solution for weight management. Our clinical dietitians take the time to understand your medical history, daily routine, and food preferences. Whether you are a busy professional or managing a household, your customized nutrition plan is designed to be practical, easy to prepare, and satisfying.</p>
</div>
<div>
<h3 class="font-title-lg text-primary mb-3">Sustainable Weight Management</h3>
<p class="font-body-md">Quick fixes often lead to a cycle of yo-yo dieting. Our focus is on sustainable weight management through gradual, meaningful lifestyle changes. We educate you on portion control, mindful eating, and understanding nutritional labels, empowering you to maintain your ideal weight long after the program ends.</p>
</div>
</div>
